{"id": "massage-employer-citations-and-insurance-followup", "title": "Two employers received $16,000 in insurance citations. One business later showed coverage.", "seconds": 49.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "9afa9e06be7409e4", "words": 135, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Inspectors checked three massage businesses in August 2018.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.75, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Three", "insurance", "checks"], "sub": "Two employers received citations and stop notices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.62, 0.93, 1.2, 1.69, 2.21, 2.37, 2.74, 3.04]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The state issued two citations for workers’ compensation violations.", "t0": 3.87, "t1": 7.53, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "visit", "kicker": "Two employers received citations and stop notices", "text": "Two citations", "mark": "Two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.53, 0.88, 1.1, 1.71, 1.86, 2.22, 2.87]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One was for $10,000. The other was for $6,000.", "t0": 7.65, "t1": 11.8, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "source": "visit", "heading": "State insurance citations", "context": "August 17, 2018", "rows": [{"label": "One employer", "value": "$10,000"}, {"label": "Other employer", "value": "$6,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.4, 0.57, 0.82, 1.17, 2.23, 2.43, 2.65, 2.82, 3.01, 3.27, 3.65]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Both employers received notices to stop labor operations until compliant.", "t0": 11.92, "t1": 15.94, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "visit", "kicker": "Two employers received citations and stop notices", "text": "Stop notices", "mark": "Stop"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.81, 1.16, 1.59, 1.73, 2.09, 2.4, 2.98, 3.27]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The third employer was directed to appear before state officials.", "t0": 16.06, "t1": 19.24, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Third employer"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 0.92, 1.1, 1.51, 1.64, 1.99, 2.33, 2.58]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One business obtained a year of insurance beginning August 23.", "t0": 19.46, "t1": 23.03, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "One business subsequently obtained coverage", "text": "August 23, 2018", "mark": "August"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.65, 1.08, 1.22, 1.49, 1.59, 2.11, 2.53, 2.87]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It registered with the state employment department in September.", "t0": 23.15, "t1": 26.0, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "One business subsequently obtained coverage", "text": "September 2018", "mark": "September"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.69, 0.85, 0.98, 1.29, 1.69, 2.14, 2.29]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The grant reports do not show how much the state collected.", "t0": 26.12, "t1": 29.03, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Collection unverified"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.5, 0.94, 1.1, 1.3, 1.58, 1.72, 1.94, 2.06, 2.35]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "During the pandemic, inspectors delivered letters to 12 businesses.", "t0": 29.25, "t1": 33.05, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letters", "kicker": "A later letter campaign used a different inspection method", "text": "April 2020", "mark": "April"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.36, 1.19, 1.82, 2.25, 2.57, 2.72, 3.09]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "They did not enter the premises to verify employees.", "t0": 33.17, "t1": 35.86, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No entry to verify employees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.31, 0.52, 0.79, 0.91, 1.4, 1.54, 1.96]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Six businesses responded by mid-July.", "t0": 35.98, "t1": 38.1, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "Six responses", "label": "A later letter campaign used a different inspection method"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.85, 1.32, 1.49]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Four supplied proof of coverage. Two said they intended to get insurance.", "t0": 38.22, "t1": 42.4, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "letters", "heading": "Six responses", "context": "Mid-July 2020", "rows": [{"label": "Proof of coverage", "value": "Four"}, {"label": "Intended to obtain insurance", "value": "Two"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.79, 1.08, 1.2, 2.22, 2.49, 2.71, 2.89, 3.27, 3.35, 3.52]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A missing response alone does not establish an uninsured workforce.", "t0": 42.52, "t1": 46.24, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Follow-up remained open"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 0.87, 1.26, 1.44, 1.61, 2.11, 2.26, 2.78]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 46.36, "t1": 48.73, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two employers received citations and stop notices", "b": "One business subsequently obtained coverage", "o": "A later letter campaign used a different inspection method"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "number"}